By default, CloudTrail logs management events but not data events like S3 GetObject/DeleteObject or Lambda Invoke calls - those need explicit configuration. I'm fairly confident on this but should verify it, then check their actual trails using describe_trails and get_event_selectors to confirm what's enabled.

